  instruction?: string;
  // Search query or question.
  query: string;
  // Enable deeper thinking for complex analysis (default: false).
  thinking?: boolean;
  // Optional specific URLs to fetch and analyze alongside the search.
  urls?: Array<string>;
}): Promise<string>; };
```

